	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc02gym0202_old_leader2_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アロエ『……ホネ？▼
そりゃ　はくぶつかん　だし
ホネは　あるけどね▼
なんだい？
こんどの　モチーフ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T08:50:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T07:06:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アロエ『……ホネ？▼
そりゃ　北部着かんだし
ホネは　あるけどね▼
なんだい？
今度の　モチーフ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T08:50:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
