	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc02gym0202_old_leader3_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アーティ『そうかなあ……？▼
いや　そうじゃないかも……▼
むしポケモンの　ばあい
そとがわが　かたい……▽
いわゆる　がいこっかく　でしょ▼
ホネは　あまり　というか
よく　わかんない▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T07:50:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T07:06:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アーティ『そうかなあ……？▼
いや　そうじゃないかも……▼
むしポケモンの　場合
外側が　硬い……▽
いわゆる　外骨格　でしょ▼
ホネは　あまり　というか
よく　わかんない▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T08:50:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T07:06:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T07:33:55" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_LEADER3
アーティ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T07:33:44" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-09T09:05:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
