	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc02gym0202_old_leader5_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヤーコン『おお！　これだ　これ！▼
で　どうだ？▼
しりょうかちが　たかいか
うって　たかいか　どっちだ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T08:25:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T08:24:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヤーコン『おお！　これだ　これ！▼
で　どうだ？▼
資料価値が　高いか
売って　高いか　どっちだ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T08:54:37" />
