				Time="2011-09-04T08:28:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アロエ『うん　微妙なんだけど▼
ネジ山の　土とは
ちょっと　違うようだね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T08:55:23" />
